The masterlist.yaml and prelude.yaml files in this directory are copied from the LOOT
masterlist repositories at https://github.com/loot (branch v0.29), which publish them under
CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

masterlists.lock.json records the repository, commit, SHA-256 and download date of each file.
tools/loot-masterlists/update.sh regenerates the files and the lock.
